/E (Throughout Christian history, faithful witnesses have reflected these truths in their lives. One inspiring example is Dietrich Bonhoeffer, who stood firmly for Christ amidst injustice and oppression during a dark period of world history. His commitment to discipleship, truth, and sacrificial faith continues to inspire Christians around the world. Likewise, many ordinary believers in our own generation quietly reflect Christ through acts of forgiveness, service, generosity, and steadfast faithfulness in difficult circumstances.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [4]
